  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"5ffb1336-e297-45e4-a08f-1ec58131d208\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>This feature is available from 0.93V-Bahmni</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2>Description</h2><p><strong>Configure Display Order of Patient Name Fields in Registration Page</strong></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"4df3121f-a2a8-4cab-9039-6a2d41f7569d\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[\"patientNameDisplayOrder\": [\"firstName\", \"middleName\", \"lastName\"]]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>Patient Name field can be configured only in Registration Page, by specifying the order in the &quot;patientNameDisplayOrder&quot; setting in <strong>app.json in registration</strong>.</p><ul><li><p>This configuration should include all three fields in the desired order.</p></li><li><p>If any invalid configuration is provided, the default behavior is to display <strong>FirsName, MiddleName, and LastName</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Use existing hide/show options of configuration for <strong>middleName and lastName</strong>.</p></li><li><p>The default behavior is to display FirstName, MiddleName, and LastName if a specific configuration is not specified in <strong>app.json in registration.</strong></p></li></ul><p><br /></p>",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
      "_expandable": {
        "content": "/rest/api/content/2434990081"
      }
    },
    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"5ffb1336-e297-45e4-a08f-1ec58131d208\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>This feature is available from 0.93V-Bahmni</p></div></div><h2 id=\"Configuringdisplayorderofpatientnames-Description\">Description</h2><p><strong>Configure Display Order of Patient Name Fields in Registration Page</strong></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"4df3121f-a2a8-4cab-9039-6a2d41f7569d\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;patientNameDisplayOrder&quot;: [&quot;firstName&quot;, &quot;middleName&quot;, &quot;lastName&quot;]</pre>\n</div></div><p>Patient Name field can be configured only in Registration Page, by specifying the order in the &quot;patientNameDisplayOrder&quot; setting in <strong>app.json in registration</strong>.</p><ul><li><p>This configuration should include all three fields in the desired order.</p></li><li><p>If any invalid configuration is provided, the default behavior is to display <strong>FirsName, MiddleName, and LastName</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Use existing hide/show options of configuration for <strong>middleName and lastName</strong>.</p></li><li><p>The default behavior is to display FirstName, MiddleName, and LastName if a specific configuration is not specified in <strong>app.json in registration.</strong></p></li></ul><p><br/></p>",
